flowchart TD
    start["Start here: named case<br/>Real owner and lock"]:::start
    choose["Consume slot<br/>and attachments"]
    bytes["Write once<br/>Zero, prefix or complete"]
    observe{"Publication and<br/>carrier complete?"}
    effect["Permit dependent action"]
    failed["Keep failure and bytes<br/>No later scenario"]
    start -->|1. Approved site| choose
    choose -->|2. Real bytes| bytes
    bytes -->|3. Observe result| observe
    observe -->|Success| effect
    observe -->|Failed or unknown| failed
    classDef start fill:#17324d,color:#fff,font-weight:bold,stroke:#17324d
